Cursor also reads AGENTS.md natively. This rule makes sure it is always applied.

Follow every rule in @AGENTS.md at the repository root. It is the single source of truth.
In short: a human owns every change; read before writing; small focused diffs; never invent
APIs, data or results; run lint + tests before saying "done"; never touch secrets; remind
the human to add the AI disclosure to the PR (see @AI_POLICY.md).
